; push! only records: a jump that lands on screen, as a search's end,
; is not recentred. Nor does a buffer switch, which records too, run
; jump-history:after-jump. A picker that jumps runs it, and its own
; entry, jump-history:recenter, puts point's place at the view's centre.
> (set-option! jump-history:history-key (lambda (view) #f))
> (define jumped '())
